    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University (AKU) has been awarded a $150,000 research grant to perform clinical testing of a low-cost handheld 3D medical imaging device for detecting cervical cancer in Kenya. The study is in partnership with Pensievision, Inc., an imaging technology startup.",
